<h2 id="2-initialize-wasm-at-startup" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">2. Initialize WASM at startup<a href="#2-initialize-wasm-at-startup" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2>
<p class="not-first:mt-[1.5em] leading-[1.65em] text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-200">Call <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">initWasm()</code> once before mounting your React tree. In a Next.js app, put this in <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">_app.tsx</code> or a top-level <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">layout.tsx</code>:</p>
